  "details": "Unity asset to capture windows/desktop and make them available in Unity as Texture2D.\nmain reason being for some props or animations it would be cool to have it. An example being if you have like a switch with a capture card or wanna have a video open to play, when you pull out the prop because you already have the window selected or set up, everyone can see it on the prop and everyone can see it real time. It's not a huge feature but it would be a nice thing to see. \nsome examples of this:\nhttps://github.com/hecomi/uWindowCapture\nhttps://github.com/hecomi/uDesktopDuplication\nHere is it working in action:\nhttps://twitter.com/DarkestDino/status/1380229614358953993?s=20\nhttps://twitter.com/DarkestDino/status/1380240591347388420?s=20",
